{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Arctic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979810/extras/dc9ca3c7d1dbe17e4ab17917001f29c3.poster.avif?t=1763583064\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979810/extras/dc9ca3c7d1dbe17e4ab17917001f29c3.webm?t=1763583064\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979810/extras/dc9ca3c7d1dbe17e4ab17917001f29c3.mp4?t=1763583064\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're an engineer and polar explorer who finds yourself in the wrong place at the wrong time: somewhere in the far north, on the border between Norway and Russia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nuclear explosion occurs. By sheer luck, your location in the Arctic zone spares you from the direct blast. But the aftermath is haunting\u2014you've lost all contact with the outside world, and inexplicably, there's no one else around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it's just you, your skis, the melting glaciers, a boat, and a mystery you must unravel. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game's Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep survival mechanics: cold environment, clothing management, hunger and thirst, day-night cycle, dynamic weather, and more</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skiing movement system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boating navigation</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting system</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various enemies (polar bears, wolves, and scavengers)</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you love these games, this is for you:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Long Dark</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Long Drive</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Forest</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sons of the Forest</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sunkenland</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DayZ</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find out what happened and escape the Arctic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you explore this empty world, you'll find clues about what happened, and why no one else is around. Put together the pieces of the story and uncover secrets hidden under the ice.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2979810?t=1763583064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979810/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763583064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979810/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763583064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2979810/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763583064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game includes content that may not be suitable for all ages or for viewing in a work environment. It features violence, mature content, and realistic violence, including but not limited to:\r\n\r\n- Blood\r\n- Violent acts\r\n- Accidental death\r\n- Bodily injury\r\n\r\nPlease note that the content involves killing."},"controller_support":